WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:02.917
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.941 --> 00:04.276
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.300 --> 00:07.516
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.540 --> 00:13.100
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.100 --> 01:31.060
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.220 --> 01:34.460
=Episode 30=

01:40.010 --> 01:41.410
Greetings, Your Highness.

01:47.285 --> 01:48.310
Don't worry.

01:48.910 --> 01:51.335
My disciple will be right back.

01:57.710 --> 01:58.535
Your Highness,

01:58.685 --> 02:00.110
what are you doing?

02:00.485 --> 02:02.460
Thank you for taking care of my brother.

02:03.410 --> 02:04.920
Didn't I tell you?

02:04.960 --> 02:07.110
He's my disciple
and I should take care of him.

02:07.560 --> 02:08.211
Senior.

02:08.235 --> 02:08.890
Ah?

02:08.935 --> 02:10.611
Mount Longhu and Mount Hui

02:10.635 --> 02:12.060
are only separated by a river.

02:12.510 --> 02:15.360
You must be familiar
with the Xuanyuan Family, aren't you?

02:16.160 --> 02:17.335
I know a little bit.

02:17.860 --> 02:18.610
Why?

02:18.810 --> 02:21.960
He wants to draw the Xuanyuan Family
over to his side.

02:22.435 --> 02:24.816
The Xuanyuan Family
is an influential clan.

02:24.840 --> 02:25.840
Besides,

02:26.135 --> 02:29.835
Old Ancestor Xuanyuan Dapan
of the Celestial Realm

02:30.410 --> 02:32.536
won't easily work
for North Liang, will he?

02:32.560 --> 02:33.200
Take it easy.

02:33.435 --> 02:34.510
Let's just have a talk.

02:34.785 --> 02:35.785
Oh.

02:35.910 --> 02:36.985
About what?

02:37.435 --> 02:39.585
About interesting stories
of the Xuanyuan Family.

02:41.035 --> 02:42.336
There are some.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.360
Tell me about them.

02:43.760 --> 02:44.861
Why do you want to know the stories?

02:44.885 --> 02:46.616
I'm going back to Shu soon.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.856
Maybe they'll be helpful.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.235
You just want to gossip.

02:49.485 --> 02:51.056
You just don't understand.

02:51.080 --> 02:51.987
Shu?

02:52.011 --> 02:54.285
Why are you going back there?

02:54.685 --> 02:55.836
She's the princess of West Chu.

02:55.860 --> 02:56.860
Oh. Ah?

02:57.385 --> 02:58.136
Never mind.

02:58.160 --> 02:59.160
Let's continue.

02:59.285 --> 03:00.421
Your Highness,

03:00.445 --> 03:02.856
I'm at least an Arch-Taoist
of Mount Longhu.

03:02.880 --> 03:03.776
But you exposed her identity to me?

03:03.800 --> 03:04.577
It doesn't matter.

03:04.601 --> 03:05.856
You're Huangman'er's master.

03:05.880 --> 03:06.880
We're a family.

03:07.960 --> 03:10.261
Don't you fear that I'll arrest her?

03:10.285 --> 03:10.960
Go ahead.

03:11.060 --> 03:12.060
What?

03:12.610 --> 03:13.880
Cao Changqing is following her.

03:14.735 --> 03:16.435
Invincible Cao Changqing?

03:16.585 --> 03:17.177
Yes.

03:17.201 --> 03:18.635
My Mr. Chess Master.

03:20.635 --> 03:21.360
Very well.

03:21.585 --> 03:24.296
Let's get back to the interesting stories
of the Xuanyuan Family.

03:24.320 --> 03:25.320
All right.

03:30.610 --> 03:33.310
(The Xuanyuan Family, Mount Hui)

03:35.135 --> 03:37.860
(Xuanyuan Jingcheng's wife)

04:02.535 --> 04:03.535
Mother.

04:05.060 --> 04:06.285
Why are you back?

04:11.035 --> 04:12.385
Old Ancestor summoned me.

04:16.685 --> 04:18.205
He asked me to enter Wending Pavilion.

04:18.760 --> 04:20.111
If I get the instruction from him,

04:20.135 --> 04:21.256
I may get back

04:21.280 --> 04:22.685
the power of our family.

04:24.660 --> 04:26.260
You don't need to tell me anything

04:26.360 --> 04:27.680
about the Xuanyuan Family.

04:29.560 --> 04:30.685
If one day

04:31.235 --> 04:33.110
you take control of the Xuanyuan Family,

04:34.460 --> 04:35.760
remember to expel me.

04:36.410 --> 04:37.860
But you and Father are a couple.

04:38.435 --> 04:39.720
Have I ever begged you before?

04:43.210 --> 04:43.910
Fine.

04:44.160 --> 04:45.720
You shouldn't have come back.

04:48.535 --> 04:49.810
What makes you say that?

04:50.035 --> 04:51.296
You've always been looked down upon

04:51.320 --> 04:52.486
and you don't dare
to fight for anything.

04:52.510 --> 04:53.550
I don't care.

04:54.010 --> 04:55.016
But now I've got a chance

04:55.040 --> 04:56.560
to get back what we deserve.

04:56.710 --> 04:57.910
Why are you trying to stop me?

04:58.435 --> 04:59.610
Xuanyuan Dapan

05:00.035 --> 05:01.735
doesn't mean to instruct you.

05:01.785 --> 05:02.657
Then why did he

05:02.681 --> 05:04.210
summon me to Wending Pavilion?

05:04.435 --> 05:05.635
For a chat?

05:10.860 --> 05:11.935
He wants to marry you

05:16.835 --> 05:17.885
for better martial arts.

05:25.035 --> 05:26.360
Are you out of your mind?

05:26.760 --> 05:28.096
He's Old Ancestor of our family.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.460
He's a forefather.

05:30.635 --> 05:31.985
Xuanyuan Dapan

05:34.085 --> 05:35.920
isn't one of our family.

05:45.360 --> 05:47.560
Xuanyuan Dapan isn't
one of the Xuanyuan Family?

05:47.710 --> 05:48.910
How's that possible?

05:49.160 --> 05:49.937
It's true.

05:49.961 --> 05:52.335
He used to be a retainer
of the Xuanyuan Family.

05:52.410 --> 05:53.891
Later, he was a son-in-law by adoption.

05:53.915 --> 05:55.710
But isn't Xuanyuan his family name?

05:56.210 --> 05:58.160
Whoever is adopted
should use their family name.

05:59.185 --> 06:01.285
And then he even became their ancestor?

06:01.535 --> 06:03.860
He reached the Celestial Realm, anyway.

06:04.285 --> 06:06.435
His adoption is always kept secret.

06:06.710 --> 06:08.610
Only old men like us are aware.

06:09.585 --> 06:11.386
So, the Xuanyuan Family

06:11.410 --> 06:12.640
are his offspring?

06:12.885 --> 06:13.720
No.

06:13.880 --> 06:15.376
None of his offspring

06:15.400 --> 06:17.861
was alive

06:17.885 --> 06:19.286
after years of martial struggle.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.411
They all died?

06:20.435 --> 06:21.435
Mm.

06:21.510 --> 06:23.270
The Xuanyuan Family
was watching out for him.

06:23.960 --> 06:24.961
At that time,

06:24.985 --> 06:26.585
he didn't reach the Celestial Realm yet.

06:26.880 --> 06:28.360
He had to bear it.

06:28.985 --> 06:31.025
Then why is he still staying
in the Xuanyuan Family?

06:31.160 --> 06:32.461
It's indeed weird.

06:32.485 --> 06:33.810
His offspring died.

06:34.010 --> 06:35.656
But he has been staying

06:35.680 --> 06:36.936
in the Xuanyuan Family willingly

06:36.960 --> 06:38.035
as Old Ancestor.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.416
I'm afraid he indeed treats himself

06:40.440 --> 06:41.185
as a member

06:41.260 --> 06:42.785
of the Xuanyuan Family.

06:42.835 --> 06:43.835
Right?

06:46.185 --> 06:47.485
He's taking revenge?

06:47.960 --> 06:49.535
Life is full of unpredictability.

06:50.110 --> 06:51.275
Who would expect him

06:51.485 --> 06:53.235
to reach the Celestial Realm

06:53.410 --> 06:55.760
and even become
the ancestor of our family?

06:56.085 --> 06:57.520
He was injured in his early years

06:57.760 --> 06:59.160
so that he didn't have a child.

06:59.385 --> 07:01.085
Now, in the Celestial Realm,

07:02.010 --> 07:03.185
he has the chance

07:03.310 --> 07:05.336
to have his own children.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.960
Why did he pick me?

07:07.285 --> 07:09.010
He's been waiting for this day.

07:09.685 --> 07:11.235
He wants our family

07:11.485 --> 07:13.311
to be his real lineage.

07:13.335 --> 07:14.920
But he's so old.

07:15.210 --> 07:17.710
He hates lineal descendants
of our family.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.410
How's that possible?

07:20.910 --> 07:22.360
Is that true?

07:26.885 --> 07:28.640
This is a secret,

07:29.110 --> 07:31.320
but your uncles know that.

07:32.510 --> 07:34.085
Then why did they ask me to come back?

07:34.335 --> 07:35.860
I'm their niece.

07:38.960 --> 07:40.640
Why didn't you tell Yuan Tingshan

07:40.810 --> 07:42.785
so that I would know the truth?

07:43.760 --> 07:44.860
I told him.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.120
What?

07:46.360 --> 07:48.000
My father doesn't want me
to go back home.

07:48.235 --> 07:49.675
There must be a reason, isn't there?

07:51.710 --> 07:52.790
He didn't give me a reason.

07:53.610 --> 07:55.160
I explained everything to him

07:55.460 --> 07:57.435
so that he would tell you the truth.

07:59.560 --> 08:00.935
Why did he keep it from me?

08:01.910 --> 08:03.460
Your family

08:03.885 --> 08:05.160
is quite filthy.

08:12.085 --> 08:13.185
I'm leaving.

08:28.760 --> 08:29.760
Don't worry.

08:29.910 --> 08:32.060
I won't let Qingfeng get hurt.

08:35.385 --> 08:36.720
What do you think you can do?

08:47.335 --> 08:48.860
(Mount Hui)

08:57.635 --> 08:58.661
Uncle Jingyi.

08:58.685 --> 09:01.010
(Mount Hui)

09:03.535 --> 09:05.210
Tomorrow, Old Ancestor will see you.

09:05.260 --> 09:06.260
You mustn't leave.

09:06.535 --> 09:08.335
You should know what he's going to do.

09:08.510 --> 09:09.760
His order

09:09.910 --> 09:10.910
cannot be disobeyed.

09:11.285 --> 09:13.060
But I'm your niece.

09:13.685 --> 09:16.335
Our family needs a man
of the Celestial Realm.

09:16.560 --> 09:17.685
Without him,

09:17.935 --> 09:19.440
we would no longer be powerful.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.610
So, you're sacrificing me?

09:23.085 --> 09:24.360
After he marries you,

09:24.460 --> 09:27.660
he'll indeed be connected
with our family.

09:28.485 --> 09:31.135
Our clan has been inherited
for centuries.

09:31.635 --> 09:33.060
It can't be ruined.

09:35.235 --> 09:36.360
For our family,

09:36.635 --> 09:37.635
you mustn't leave.

09:38.085 --> 09:39.260
When I'm here,

09:40.610 --> 09:42.085
you're not able to leave, either.

10:10.410 --> 10:11.435
You knew everything?

10:11.735 --> 10:13.285
Why didn't you tell me the truth?

10:14.660 --> 10:15.960
You had to come back,

10:16.260 --> 10:17.880
or I would be a retainer all my life.

10:18.080 --> 10:20.456
After I enter Wending Pavilion,
you can be a member of my family?

10:20.480 --> 10:21.810
After I marry you,

10:22.400 --> 10:23.520
I can be one of your family.

10:24.160 --> 10:25.311
I'll marry you

10:25.335 --> 10:26.680
and change my family name.

10:27.085 --> 10:27.897
Xuanyuan Dapan

10:27.921 --> 10:29.600
is a master of the Celestial Realm.

10:30.135 --> 10:32.285
He won't marry
someone else's wife, will he?

10:32.585 --> 10:33.660
Yuan Tingshan!

10:33.960 --> 10:34.960
Be patient.

10:36.660 --> 10:38.040
I know you don't like me.

10:38.485 --> 10:39.485
It doesn't matter.

10:40.585 --> 10:41.810
After we get married,

10:41.910 --> 10:44.036
you can like anyone you want.

10:44.060 --> 10:45.585
I won't sleep with you.

10:47.910 --> 10:49.360
What exactly do you want?

10:50.310 --> 10:51.810
A chance.

10:52.785 --> 10:54.010
A man like me

10:55.210 --> 10:56.696
has been living a humble life

10:56.720 --> 10:58.911
and I've only learned
the second-rate artistry of blade.

10:58.935 --> 10:59.857
The lost martial arts

10:59.881 --> 11:00.976
have always been kept

11:01.000 --> 11:02.080
by famous clans like yours.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.120
I won't have access to Wending Pavilion

11:04.800 --> 11:06.296
or make it to the top

11:06.320 --> 11:07.890
unless I'm one of the Xuanyuan Family.

11:09.235 --> 11:11.240
Xuanyuan Dapan reached
the Celestial Realm.

11:11.920 --> 11:13.040
Why can't I make it?

11:13.240 --> 11:14.240
Funny.

11:14.985 --> 11:16.510
You think I'll marry you?

11:19.435 --> 11:20.761
Think about it carefully.

11:20.785 --> 11:21.785
You will

11:21.910 --> 11:24.286
marry a dying widower

11:24.310 --> 11:25.310
or

11:25.910 --> 11:28.080
Marry me to get away.

11:29.185 --> 11:30.535
You have only one night.

11:30.885 --> 11:31.935
Don't think for too long.

12:01.560 --> 12:03.535
I heard your daughter tried to leave.

12:04.920 --> 12:06.285
Jingyi stopped her, didn't he?

12:07.285 --> 12:09.060
Go persuade her when you have time.

12:09.710 --> 12:11.910
We've raised her for years.

12:12.510 --> 12:14.760
It's time for her to repay us.

12:15.160 --> 12:16.560
Xuanyuan Dapan

12:17.710 --> 12:19.560
will not stop.

12:19.960 --> 12:20.960
I know that.

12:22.335 --> 12:23.640
He wants

12:24.110 --> 12:26.760
to enjoy all girls of this generation.

12:29.085 --> 12:30.400
And you'll let him be?

12:32.635 --> 12:34.185
He's in the Celestial Realm.

12:34.960 --> 12:35.985
With him,

12:36.360 --> 12:38.585
our family will always be prestigious.

12:39.060 --> 12:40.210
When he's satisfied,

12:40.510 --> 12:42.810
he's still Old Ancestor of our family.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.110
And our family

12:44.360 --> 12:45.710
can be inheritable.

12:52.285 --> 12:54.010
Without righteousness,

12:54.935 --> 12:56.485
what's the point of inheritance?

12:59.510 --> 13:00.910
Who told you that?

13:01.410 --> 13:02.910
I read about it from books.

13:03.410 --> 13:05.485
Can you reach the Celestial Realm
by reading books?

13:05.760 --> 13:06.760
Jingcheng,

13:08.310 --> 13:10.535
after Qingfeng marries Old Ancestor,

13:10.885 --> 13:13.135
you'll have no offspring.

13:13.260 --> 13:14.645
Why not

13:14.985 --> 13:17.640
hand your connections over to me?

13:18.535 --> 13:20.485
I'm more humane than Jingyi.

13:21.710 --> 13:23.080
I won't embarrass you.

13:25.010 --> 13:27.460
You've been waiting for this day,
haven't you?

13:32.260 --> 13:33.685
Don't put me on the spot.

13:38.785 --> 13:40.435
If you don't understand,

13:41.335 --> 13:42.960
I can go talk with your wife.

13:45.010 --> 13:46.485
She always looks down on you.

13:47.385 --> 13:48.520
Over the years,

13:49.985 --> 13:51.680
she has been having a hard time.

14:18.840 --> 14:19.840
Actually,

14:21.985 --> 14:24.060
one can also reach the Celestial Realm

14:26.535 --> 14:28.280
by reading books.

14:37.110 --> 14:38.361
Fengnian, hawthorns for you.

14:38.385 --> 14:39.585
Only these hawthorns are ripe.

14:43.120 --> 14:44.161
He has stayed

14:44.185 --> 14:46.261
by the hawthorn tree every day,

14:46.285 --> 14:48.135
waiting to pick some for you.

14:51.000 --> 14:51.635
It tastes great.

14:51.910 --> 14:52.910
Thank you, Huangman'er.

14:58.610 --> 14:59.610
Eh?

15:00.160 --> 15:01.160
What?

15:02.235 --> 15:03.240
Interesting.

15:56.310 --> 15:57.536
(Great Prestige, Gold Path)

15:57.560 --> 16:00.080
(Eternal Longevity, Cultivate for Eternity,
Unity of Everything)

16:04.610 --> 16:05.985
(Xiaoyao Temple)

16:20.660 --> 16:21.910
Xu Xiao's son?

16:30.635 --> 16:31.635
That's me.

16:32.710 --> 16:33.910
You two indeed look alike.

16:35.560 --> 16:37.060
A little bit in appearance,

16:37.735 --> 16:39.410
but a lot in spirit.

16:41.185 --> 16:42.320
Who are you?

16:44.585 --> 16:45.885
Xuanyuan Jingcheng.

16:49.735 --> 16:50.860
Qingfeng's father.

16:52.035 --> 16:53.296
You don't do martial arts, do you?

16:53.320 --> 16:54.320
Why could you fly to me?

16:58.610 --> 16:59.935
I have a portrait.

17:00.985 --> 17:02.785
You look like the person in it.

17:03.910 --> 17:04.935
I don't understand.

17:05.910 --> 17:07.585
The person in the portrait

17:07.660 --> 17:09.610
is closely linked with you.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.035
You indeed look like her

17:11.135 --> 17:12.835
in appearance.

17:18.310 --> 17:19.785
Who

17:21.385 --> 17:22.510
are you talking about?

17:22.935 --> 17:24.710
You look as graceful

17:25.435 --> 17:27.710
as your mother used to be.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.480
Shut up!

17:43.160 --> 17:45.510
Uncle Jingyi has blocked all the ways
away from Mount Hui.

17:48.460 --> 17:50.610
Now that they want to give you
to Old Ancestor,

17:51.060 --> 17:52.720
they won't let you leave.

17:54.585 --> 17:55.856
I was dubious

17:55.880 --> 17:57.200
of what Father told me.

17:58.320 --> 18:00.040
But now I know it's true.

18:01.860 --> 18:02.860
Mother,

18:03.040 --> 18:04.410
do you have a way to leave?

18:06.410 --> 18:07.835
If I did,

18:08.535 --> 18:09.575
I would have left already.

18:09.710 --> 18:11.575
So, we don't have a way out?

18:15.910 --> 18:17.910
Xu Fengnian sent you
back to Mount Hui?

18:19.240 --> 18:20.460
Are you saying

18:20.910 --> 18:22.410
that I should ask him for help?

18:25.920 --> 18:27.720
How can he interfere
with our family business?

18:28.235 --> 18:29.760
If he didn't want to interfere,

18:30.210 --> 18:32.035
he wouldn't have given you a ride.

18:36.860 --> 18:38.310
I can't even leave Mount Hui.

18:38.560 --> 18:39.760
How can I beg him for help?

19:16.240 --> 19:17.510
You don't help your brother?

19:20.435 --> 19:21.435
I don't need to.

19:21.485 --> 19:22.910
That uncle doesn't mean to fight.

19:31.385 --> 19:32.680
How do you know?

19:33.510 --> 19:34.810
I just know.

20:06.010 --> 20:07.010
So much for this.

20:12.210 --> 20:14.320
God of Sword, you've got an heir

20:14.585 --> 20:15.720
for your Snakes in Sleeves.

20:16.285 --> 20:18.035
He's using it poorly.

20:19.485 --> 20:20.760
He's the right person.

20:21.335 --> 20:22.576
His Highness isn't talented enough

20:22.600 --> 20:23.960
for the moment.

20:24.600 --> 20:25.685
But given some time,

20:26.335 --> 20:28.343
he'll inherit your great martial arts.

20:28.367 --> 20:29.035
Come on.

20:29.185 --> 20:30.185
He isn't as talented

20:30.335 --> 20:31.560
as his little brother.

20:38.310 --> 20:39.830
This boy is born in the Diamond Realm.

20:40.660 --> 20:42.086
He's generally beyond compare.

20:42.110 --> 20:43.660
Now that you're not here for a fight,

20:43.935 --> 20:45.335
stop gossiping about my mother.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.735
I wasn't gossiping.

20:47.935 --> 20:49.000
I was telling the truth.

20:49.335 --> 20:50.816
You indeed look like your mother.

20:50.840 --> 20:52.910
What does it have to do
with your portrait?

20:56.685 --> 20:57.936
(Jianjia House)

20:57.960 --> 20:59.185
To be honest,

21:00.260 --> 21:01.840
the person in the portrait

21:02.080 --> 21:03.860
is your mother.

21:05.985 --> 21:07.410
You met my mother?

21:07.660 --> 21:08.760
My wife did.

21:09.035 --> 21:10.075
She portrayed your mother.

21:10.685 --> 21:11.685
Wait.

21:12.235 --> 21:13.735
Why did your wife

21:14.060 --> 21:16.120
portray my mother?

21:17.010 --> 21:19.660
When my wife met your mother,

21:20.060 --> 21:22.585
your mother was disguised as a man.

21:26.060 --> 21:27.560
Your wife never knew that?

21:28.010 --> 21:29.410
When she got to know the truth,

21:30.260 --> 21:31.960
she had fallen in love

21:32.510 --> 21:33.776
with your mother.

21:33.800 --> 21:36.240
But she knew they couldn't be together.

21:36.560 --> 21:38.800
So, she portrayed the person
in her memory.

21:39.660 --> 21:40.880
To her,

21:41.660 --> 21:43.010
she only wanted

21:44.060 --> 21:45.240
to remember

21:46.335 --> 21:48.680
the young swordsman who attracted her.

21:48.935 --> 21:50.800
So, she only loves

21:51.960 --> 21:53.640
the person in the portrait.

21:54.935 --> 21:56.210
What do you want?

21:59.985 --> 22:02.185
Xuanyuan Dapan wants to marry Qingfeng.

22:04.135 --> 22:05.235
How old

22:05.560 --> 22:06.487
is Xuanyuan Dapan?

22:06.511 --> 22:07.760
Nearly a hundred years old.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.800
Shame on him!

22:10.185 --> 22:11.511
If people know about it,

22:11.535 --> 22:13.336
our family will be laughed at.

22:13.360 --> 22:15.110
Xuanyuan Dapan is
in the Celestial Realm.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.536
No one dares to laugh at him.

22:16.560 --> 22:17.760
So, great martial arts

22:18.160 --> 22:19.936
can make people
ignore the sense of shame?

22:19.960 --> 22:21.335
That's right.

22:21.535 --> 22:22.137
So?

22:22.161 --> 22:23.285
Could you leave Mount Hui

22:23.585 --> 22:25.021
and take my message to Xu Fengnian?

22:25.045 --> 22:25.762
No.

22:25.786 --> 22:27.161
I haven't told you what message it is.

22:27.185 --> 22:29.261
Even if North Liang is interested
in the Xuanyuan Family,

22:29.285 --> 22:30.935
why must they work with you?

22:31.035 --> 22:33.261
They could talk to your uncles.

22:33.285 --> 22:35.111
Will Xu Fengnian really offend
a master of the Celestial Realm

22:35.135 --> 22:37.485
just for you?

22:37.885 --> 22:39.060
You have only one option.

22:39.385 --> 22:40.885
Marry me tonight

22:41.310 --> 22:42.640
and make me one of your family.

22:43.735 --> 22:45.720
You've been waiting for this day, right?

22:48.360 --> 22:49.685
On Mount Hui,

22:50.510 --> 22:51.685
no one dares to marry you,

22:52.360 --> 22:53.485
but me.

22:57.210 --> 22:58.210
After tonight,

22:58.520 --> 22:59.600
you'll have no more chance.

23:00.520 --> 23:01.520
Fine!

23:02.185 --> 23:03.185
Let's get married!

23:07.960 --> 23:08.960
Let's do it tonight.

23:09.760 --> 23:11.240
We would be stopped if we did it now.

23:26.860 --> 23:27.976
Xuanyuan Dapan

23:28.000 --> 23:29.961
wants all descendants
of the Xuanyuan Family

23:29.985 --> 23:31.810
to be his.

23:33.035 --> 23:34.176
So, what he wants

23:34.200 --> 23:35.710
is more than marrying your daughter.

23:37.885 --> 23:41.360
Why can such a man
be a master of the Celestial Realm?

23:41.735 --> 23:44.016
The level of martial arts
has nothing to do with morality.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.435
Mr. Jingcheng,

23:49.810 --> 23:50.985
you didn't only come

23:51.260 --> 23:52.586
to tell us about the scandal

23:52.610 --> 23:53.860
in your family, did you?

23:59.480 --> 24:01.260
I'm going to kill Xuanyuan Dapan.

24:02.760 --> 24:04.360
But he's a master
of the Celestial Realm.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.400
In the past twenty years or so,

24:07.860 --> 24:11.210
I've learned all the secret martial arts
in Wending Pavilion.

24:12.120 --> 24:13.320
Are you sure you can kill him?

24:15.840 --> 24:17.800
In five years, I'll be able to kill him.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.400
But now I'm running out of time.

24:21.460 --> 24:22.485
When I fight him,

24:23.460 --> 24:24.611
no matter I win or lose,

24:24.635 --> 24:25.935
I'll die.

24:26.840 --> 24:28.260
I'm not afraid of death.

24:29.435 --> 24:30.660
But I worry

24:31.120 --> 24:32.280
about some people.

24:32.610 --> 24:33.640
Your wife and daughter.

24:38.760 --> 24:40.060
After I die,

24:40.760 --> 24:43.010
I don't know

24:43.360 --> 24:44.485
how they'll end up.

24:46.520 --> 24:47.735
Luckily, you've come.

24:48.120 --> 24:49.235
In this world,

24:51.485 --> 24:53.920
no one can save them, but you.

24:54.460 --> 24:55.960
Why must I save them?

24:58.785 --> 25:00.335
After Xuanyuan Dapan dies,

25:00.535 --> 25:02.485
my daughter will take over Mount Hui.

25:02.860 --> 25:04.210
But she's too young.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.935
She needs time
to build up a stable foundation.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.335
During that,

25:09.160 --> 25:12.460
you can use her as a puppet

25:13.235 --> 25:14.835
and take control of the Xuanyuan Family.

25:14.935 --> 25:16.740
From then on, Mount Hui

25:17.610 --> 25:19.290
will fall under the control
of North Liang.

25:21.760 --> 25:23.610
Who told you that we wanted Mount Hui?

25:24.060 --> 25:25.710
What worries you, Your Highness?

25:26.285 --> 25:27.610
You have two brothers.

25:28.110 --> 25:30.035
One of them, Xuanyuan Jingxuan,

25:30.210 --> 25:31.895
has controlled Mount Hui for years.

25:32.010 --> 25:33.635
But your daughter has no supporters.

25:33.810 --> 25:35.271
Even if I support her,

25:35.295 --> 25:36.785
she might not defeat them.

25:37.685 --> 25:38.685
You made sense.

25:39.810 --> 25:41.885
I understand what you're talking about.

25:42.280 --> 25:44.686
You don't want to marry your daughter
to Xuanyuan Dapan.

25:44.710 --> 25:46.510
You don't need to kill him.

25:46.660 --> 25:47.816
Bring your daughter here

25:47.840 --> 25:48.856
and marry her to His Highness.

25:48.880 --> 25:49.936
It's a perfect plan.

25:49.960 --> 25:50.960
Isn't it?

25:53.520 --> 25:55.085
Xuanyuan Dapan can get

25:55.360 --> 25:56.560
whatever he wants.

25:56.985 --> 25:58.435
He doesn't care

25:58.785 --> 25:59.861
even if Qingfeng is married
to someone else.

25:59.885 --> 26:00.585
How about this?

26:00.835 --> 26:02.960
Come to our sect for shelter
with your family.

26:03.360 --> 26:04.385
We're neighbors.

26:04.535 --> 26:05.696
It's convenient

26:05.720 --> 26:07.311
to help each other, isn't it?

26:07.335 --> 26:08.655
We can't come to you for shelter.

26:08.800 --> 26:09.786
Why?

26:09.810 --> 26:11.136
When we take action,

26:11.160 --> 26:12.860
we'll certainly keep your daughter safe.

26:13.310 --> 26:15.035
You're too close to Mount Hui.

26:15.535 --> 26:16.585
If you interfere,

26:17.260 --> 26:18.260
our family

26:18.680 --> 26:20.060
will never have our day.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.985
Only North Liang can help you?

26:24.210 --> 26:25.260
Yes.

26:25.710 --> 26:27.260
What about your brothers?

26:28.785 --> 26:30.386
I'll kill Xuanyuan Jingxuan first.

26:30.410 --> 26:31.410
When?

26:32.685 --> 26:33.785
Immediately.

26:36.735 --> 26:37.935
In two hours,

26:38.660 --> 26:40.585
I'll go to Hill Guniu

26:41.235 --> 26:43.395
and have a life-and-death fight
against Xuanyuan Dapan.

26:45.560 --> 26:46.785
Your Highness,

26:47.060 --> 26:49.110
I invite you to go and watch it.

26:50.660 --> 26:51.710
What if I don't go?

26:58.360 --> 26:59.610
Your Highness,

27:02.035 --> 27:03.860
you can decide the destiny of my family.

27:18.435 --> 27:20.136
If he were really sincere,

27:20.160 --> 27:21.576
he should have brought Xuanyuan Qingfeng

27:21.600 --> 27:22.610
as the hostage.

27:22.910 --> 27:24.485
There's no such thing as free lunch.

27:24.860 --> 27:27.185
He only gave you the bait.

27:27.310 --> 27:29.200
Xu Fengnian is Xu Xiao's son.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.136
As long as he appears on Mount Hui

27:31.160 --> 27:32.235
within two hours,

27:32.360 --> 27:33.861
it's like a declaration

27:33.885 --> 27:36.111
that he'll interfere
with the coup of the Xuanyuan Family.

27:36.135 --> 27:38.416
By then, even if he wants
to step backward,

27:38.440 --> 27:39.440
he can hardly do that.

27:39.810 --> 27:41.696
But it's true

27:41.720 --> 27:43.136
that there'll be a fight
in the Xuanyuan Family.

27:43.160 --> 27:44.516
Why don't we just watch

27:44.540 --> 27:46.260
and make a decision
after the fight is over?

27:47.360 --> 27:49.535
If I don't appear on Mount Hui
within two hours,

27:50.735 --> 27:52.775
I'll lose the chance
to control the Xuanyuan Family.

27:52.985 --> 27:54.485
It'll be risky if you go.

27:54.835 --> 27:56.835
It'll be regretful if you don't.

27:57.135 --> 27:58.135
Huangman'er,

27:58.535 --> 28:00.185
do you think I should go?

28:01.635 --> 28:02.961
Do you want to go?

28:02.985 --> 28:03.985
I do.

28:04.735 --> 28:07.310
I planned to go to Mount Hui long ago.

28:07.360 --> 28:08.706
Now, the Xuanyuan Family is in chaos.

28:08.730 --> 28:09.910
I want to see it personally.

28:10.060 --> 28:11.810
Now that you want it, do it.

28:15.835 --> 28:16.935
Good point.

28:18.160 --> 28:19.400
Now that I want it, I'll do it.

28:22.385 --> 28:23.385
Let's go!

28:24.000 --> 28:25.160
Your Highness. Your Highness.

28:25.935 --> 28:27.411
This is our bowl.

28:27.435 --> 28:28.435
A bowl

28:28.710 --> 28:29.985
costs two coins.

28:36.460 --> 28:37.460
Mother,

28:38.260 --> 28:39.485
I'm getting married tonight.

28:44.460 --> 28:45.600
You have no way out.

28:48.260 --> 28:50.180
I'll kill myself
if the worst comes to the worst.

28:51.360 --> 28:52.835
Do you want to die?

28:52.880 --> 28:53.880
Uncle Jingxuan,

28:53.910 --> 28:55.361
please don't force me.

28:55.385 --> 28:56.576
After you marry Old Ancestor,

28:56.600 --> 28:58.200
you can learn any martial arts you want.

28:58.535 --> 28:59.860
But I don't want to marry him.

29:00.235 --> 29:02.310
You're born in our family, anyway.

29:03.785 --> 29:04.785
Sister-in-law,

29:05.085 --> 29:07.000
do you know where my brother has gone?

29:07.280 --> 29:08.720
It's not my concern.

29:09.485 --> 29:10.412
Over the years,

29:10.436 --> 29:11.910
I'm sorry to have you suffer

29:12.685 --> 29:13.840
when living with my brother.

29:13.985 --> 29:15.510
I guess

29:15.860 --> 29:17.416
you know how I care for you.

29:17.440 --> 29:18.312
Uncle Jingxuan...

29:18.336 --> 29:20.011
My nerd brother

29:20.035 --> 29:21.885
doesn't know how women feel.

29:22.535 --> 29:25.010
Women often feel lonely.

29:25.610 --> 29:26.910
Am I right?

29:27.320 --> 29:28.410
Sister-in-law!

29:29.135 --> 29:30.135
Let go of her.

29:30.585 --> 29:32.336
Don't interfere with the elders!

29:32.360 --> 29:33.435
Let go of my mother.

29:40.885 --> 29:41.856
Don't hurt her!

29:41.880 --> 29:42.880
Your Highness,

29:43.060 --> 29:44.511
there are many retainers
in the Xuanyuan Family.

29:44.535 --> 29:45.512
Now that you're going up Mount Hui,

29:45.536 --> 29:46.961
shall we bring Fengzi Battalion?

29:46.985 --> 29:49.186
When I go there only for travel,
no matter how the fight ends up,

29:49.210 --> 29:50.435
there's a turning back for me.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.560
But if I took Fengzi Battalion,

29:52.880 --> 29:53.777
it would be a different thing.

29:53.801 --> 29:55.641
Then why didn't we take
Young Master Longxiang?

29:55.735 --> 29:57.835
If we have to fight,
he can hardly control himself.

29:58.860 --> 29:59.860
Ning Emei,

30:00.235 --> 30:02.060
how many people do you think we need

30:02.685 --> 30:03.735
to wipe out this mountain?

30:05.635 --> 30:06.755
We're strong enough already.

30:13.335 --> 30:14.836
Respect your uncle.

30:14.860 --> 30:16.285
Keep that in mind!

30:17.935 --> 30:18.935
Sister-in-law,

30:19.285 --> 30:20.485
let's continue.

30:23.985 --> 30:25.520
You'd better think it all out.

30:27.010 --> 30:28.436
According to Old Ancestor,

30:28.460 --> 30:30.736
tomorrow, I'll officially be the master

30:30.760 --> 30:31.936
of the Xuanyuan Family.

30:31.960 --> 30:33.060
From tomorrow on,

30:33.535 --> 30:34.895
I don't need to consider anything.

30:38.010 --> 30:39.010
Leave.

30:39.785 --> 30:40.860
If I leave now,

30:41.260 --> 30:42.860
how can I still be your daughter?

30:48.080 --> 30:49.485
If you keep fighting me,

30:49.985 --> 30:51.696
I'll break your limbs

30:51.720 --> 30:53.885
and send you
to Old Ancestor's room personally.

31:09.360 --> 31:10.910
Why must you struggle?

31:13.235 --> 31:14.235
Wait!

31:14.510 --> 31:15.496
If I survive,

31:15.520 --> 31:16.360
I'll kill you!

31:16.385 --> 31:17.535
Jingxuan.

31:21.635 --> 31:22.635
Jingcheng?

31:29.010 --> 31:31.485
You've been quick-tempered since little.

31:32.235 --> 31:33.360
In some cases,

31:33.785 --> 31:35.535
before everything is settled,

31:36.060 --> 31:37.935
don't rush to judge.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.320
What shall I wait for, then?

31:40.610 --> 31:41.710
You?

31:42.710 --> 31:44.985
Xuanyuan Dapan gave you the pill?

31:46.840 --> 31:47.840
How do you know?

31:48.185 --> 31:49.535
I can see that.

31:50.160 --> 31:52.880
He gave me the pill
to enhance my strength.

31:53.460 --> 31:55.385
Now I'm in the Void Realm.

31:55.785 --> 31:56.935
I'm qualified

31:57.085 --> 32:00.260
to be the master of our family.

32:00.320 --> 32:01.985
Enhancing you forcibly

32:02.835 --> 32:04.860
will give you no experience.

32:06.280 --> 32:07.835
It's harmful

32:09.060 --> 32:10.735
to the development of your martial arts.

32:12.185 --> 32:14.240
Should I thank you for reminding me?

32:14.510 --> 32:15.810
Your impatience

32:16.660 --> 32:18.360
will ruin our family.

32:19.385 --> 32:20.560
So what?

32:23.185 --> 32:24.185
Jingxuan,

32:26.310 --> 32:28.310
if you leave Mount Hui

32:28.480 --> 32:29.640
and our family immediately,

32:30.885 --> 32:32.320
I'll keep you alive.

32:35.610 --> 32:36.457
Over the years,

32:36.481 --> 32:38.440
you don't even dare to enter this house.

32:39.035 --> 32:40.920
Even if I break your daughter's limbs

32:41.235 --> 32:43.240
and rape your wife

32:43.760 --> 32:45.410
right in your face,

32:46.860 --> 32:48.320
what can you do?

33:17.860 --> 33:19.510
The whole clan

33:20.585 --> 33:21.960
of Mount Hui

33:23.735 --> 33:24.835
is filthy.

33:25.310 --> 33:27.485
It's kind of timely rain.

33:27.660 --> 33:28.735
Let the rain

33:31.810 --> 33:33.160
wash it up.

33:36.610 --> 33:38.960
You're totally insane, I guess.

33:39.485 --> 33:40.680
How dare you...!

33:54.910 --> 33:56.460
It's time

33:57.710 --> 33:59.040
to change the clan's fate.

34:01.085 --> 34:03.961
(Mount Hui)

34:03.985 --> 34:04.985
Master Jingyi,

34:05.185 --> 34:07.376
Master Jingxuan was seen
to go to Master Jingcheng's house

34:07.400 --> 34:08.297
and got in an argument.

34:08.321 --> 34:09.985
He's hopeless.

34:10.285 --> 34:12.510
All he cares about is such crap.

34:12.760 --> 34:13.760
Let's go have a look.

34:14.435 --> 34:15.435
Master Jingyi.

34:17.060 --> 34:18.060
Master Jingyi,

34:18.085 --> 34:19.835
Xu Fengnian is coming up the mountain.

34:20.085 --> 34:21.686
The patrolling retainer asked
if we should stop him.

34:21.710 --> 34:22.686
Assemble our retainers.

34:22.710 --> 34:23.367
Yes.

34:23.391 --> 34:25.510
(Mount Hui)

34:25.810 --> 34:27.040
So, you can do martial arts.

34:27.135 --> 34:28.520
You've kept it from us for years.

34:28.660 --> 34:29.780
I never keep it from anyone.

34:31.385 --> 34:33.310
You just think I'm a loser

34:33.610 --> 34:35.440
when I only read books.

34:35.760 --> 34:38.080
Can you get genuine spirit by reading?

34:38.235 --> 34:39.285
Something like that.

34:39.435 --> 34:41.110
You're finally going to do something?

34:41.310 --> 34:42.811
We can't build the new
unless we destroy the old.

34:42.835 --> 34:44.800
Xuanyuan Dapan has led our clan

34:44.840 --> 34:46.200
to the wrong path.

34:46.485 --> 34:47.485
Today,

34:47.735 --> 34:49.835
I'll set things right

34:50.210 --> 34:51.810
and get our clan back on the right path.

34:51.960 --> 34:53.561
How arrogant!

34:53.585 --> 34:54.745
Speaking of martial arts,

34:55.360 --> 34:57.880
you and Jingyi can't defeat me
even if you fight together.

35:03.535 --> 35:05.210
Well, show me

35:05.985 --> 35:07.310
how talented you can be.

35:23.110 --> 35:24.610
You're in the Void Realm.

35:25.360 --> 35:27.585
I'll kill you with the same power.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.160
How's this possible?

35:32.185 --> 35:34.510
You're in the Void Realm,
but you have a poor mental state.

35:35.410 --> 35:38.385
What a waste of the Void Realm!

35:40.080 --> 35:41.080
Jingxuan,

35:41.710 --> 35:43.110
your punch

35:43.535 --> 35:46.135
wasn't even as amazing
as Xu Fengnian's brandish of his blade.

35:46.400 --> 35:47.400
Wait, Jingcheng.

35:49.200 --> 35:50.935
I'll go tell Old Ancestor.

35:51.880 --> 35:53.035
You should be

35:53.880 --> 35:55.240
the master of the Xuanyuan Family.

35:56.080 --> 35:57.840
I will kill Xuanyuan Dapan.

35:58.360 --> 35:59.760
To prosper our family,

36:00.410 --> 36:02.135
some people should be alive.

36:03.035 --> 36:04.635
I gave you a chance to make your choice.

36:04.735 --> 36:05.735
Wait, Jingcheng.

36:05.840 --> 36:07.035
I'm sorry.

36:22.160 --> 36:23.640
I'll go tell Old Ancestor.

36:25.160 --> 36:27.240
You should be the master of our family.

36:28.235 --> 36:30.560
You should be the master.

36:43.535 --> 36:44.535
He's dead?

37:20.935 --> 37:23.160
(Mount Hui)

37:28.460 --> 37:30.485
What a turbulent martial world!

37:31.535 --> 37:32.840
If you keep walking,

37:33.135 --> 37:35.280
you'll reach our private mansions.

37:35.910 --> 37:38.111
Your Highness, why are you coming here?

37:38.135 --> 37:40.296
How much further is it
from that old man's mansion?

37:40.320 --> 37:41.460
It's not very far.

37:41.785 --> 37:43.560
When we go up, we'll reach Guniujiang.

37:43.735 --> 37:45.286
There's a flatland,

37:45.310 --> 37:46.336
known as Snowfield.

37:46.360 --> 37:48.280
Xuanyuan Dapan lives there.

37:49.010 --> 37:51.960
Let's go enjoy the scenery
of Snowfield Guniujiang.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.680
Li Chungang?

37:55.560 --> 37:56.560
Your Highness,

37:56.680 --> 37:58.610
are you going to break into Mount Hui?

37:59.040 --> 38:00.585
What makes you think so?

38:01.000 --> 38:04.660
Guniujiang is where
our Old Ancestor resides.

38:05.310 --> 38:07.010
No strangers are allowed in.

38:10.935 --> 38:12.120
It's raining.

38:13.585 --> 38:14.585
What?

38:15.585 --> 38:16.640
Do you have an umbrella?

38:17.285 --> 38:18.285
Lend it to me.

38:21.985 --> 38:24.310
A jar of Danggui Wine
is sent to you every year.

38:24.635 --> 38:25.786
Have you really not tasted any?

38:25.810 --> 38:27.386
(Danggui Wine)

38:27.410 --> 38:29.640
You finally dared to do something.

38:32.485 --> 38:33.710
It tastes good.

38:34.160 --> 38:35.285
You can have a taste.

38:36.335 --> 38:37.455
It's not that I didn't dare.

38:38.035 --> 38:39.060
Our clan

38:39.485 --> 38:41.385
(Danggui Wine)
indeed owed Xuanyuan Dapan.

38:41.935 --> 38:44.410
He used to be a shield of Mount Hui.

38:46.385 --> 38:48.680
But I didn't expect him
to want my daughter.

38:52.860 --> 38:53.860
What?

38:59.640 --> 39:00.640
I...

39:01.360 --> 39:02.360
I came

39:02.560 --> 39:03.560
to tell you something.

39:03.810 --> 39:05.860
Xu Fengnian has arrived at the gate.

39:06.135 --> 39:07.685
Master Jingyi and the retainers

39:08.035 --> 39:08.837
are...

39:08.861 --> 39:10.060
are in a stalemate with him.

39:10.160 --> 39:11.310
I'm glad he has come.

39:11.560 --> 39:12.560
Off you go.

39:12.885 --> 39:13.885
Yes.

39:16.960 --> 39:18.835
Bring Xu Fengnian to Guniujiang.

39:19.235 --> 39:21.185
I'll take care of the rest.

39:21.635 --> 39:23.860
Xu Fengnian will fight Xuanyuan Dapan?

39:25.035 --> 39:26.035
Qingfeng,

39:27.110 --> 39:28.185
I'll leave your mother

39:28.860 --> 39:30.285
to you.

39:32.685 --> 39:36.135
(Danggui Wine)

39:36.260 --> 39:37.360
Xuanyuan Jingcheng,

39:39.060 --> 39:40.060
where are you going?

39:42.660 --> 39:43.710
Guniujiang.

39:44.385 --> 39:45.385
Snowfield.

39:45.610 --> 39:46.935
As the saying goes,

39:47.035 --> 39:48.235
we can't expect a better world

39:48.480 --> 39:49.800
without cleaning our rooms first.

39:51.435 --> 39:52.760
It's time

39:53.535 --> 39:55.115
to clean our rooms.

39:55.285 --> 39:56.560
You're going to fight him?

39:56.735 --> 39:58.160
But he's in the Celestial Realm!

39:59.635 --> 40:00.960
I don't care.

40:02.235 --> 40:04.060
I'll let no one hurt my daughter.

40:28.060 --> 40:29.460
I've never regretted

40:32.240 --> 40:33.335
marrying you.

40:45.810 --> 40:48.135
You can keep the umbrella,
Your Highness.

40:48.410 --> 40:50.985
But please leave immediately.

40:51.260 --> 40:53.410
Now that I want to enjoy the scenery,

40:53.560 --> 40:55.310
I insist on seeing it.

40:55.935 --> 40:57.310
Make way, please.

40:57.720 --> 40:58.720
This isn't

40:59.200 --> 41:00.710
North Liang.

41:00.835 --> 41:01.845
Stop him.

41:17.785 --> 41:19.610
Father is going to fight Old Ancestor.

41:22.235 --> 41:23.860
Why has Xu Fengnian come?

41:24.060 --> 41:25.740
Your father invited him
for you, of course.

41:26.060 --> 41:27.060
For me?

41:27.985 --> 41:29.520
If Xuanyuan Dapan dies,

41:30.385 --> 41:31.610
you can't take over Mount Hui

41:32.285 --> 41:33.640
unless you have supporters.

41:33.860 --> 41:35.960
The premise is
that Xuanyuan Dapan is killed.

41:36.360 --> 41:37.360
If he isn't killed,

41:39.060 --> 41:41.110
you can leave with Xu Fengnian.

41:44.560 --> 41:46.085
I'll take him to Guniujiang.

41:47.835 --> 41:48.835
Mother,

41:49.460 --> 41:50.960
you're not going there?

41:52.085 --> 41:53.085
I'm not.

41:53.310 --> 41:55.211
If Father really kills Xuanyuan Dapan,

41:55.235 --> 41:56.860
don't you want to see that?

42:00.010 --> 42:01.235
Get to your business.

42:02.060 --> 42:03.535
Leave me alone.

42:35.685 --> 42:38.520
(A hard life doesn't matter, )

42:40.160 --> 42:43.010
(as long as my beloved one comes back.)

42:55.535 --> 42:56.961
His Highness is going up the mountain.

42:56.985 --> 42:58.235
Make way, please.

43:29.840 --> 43:32.560
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.335 --> 43:37.135
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.060 --> 43:41.980
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.060 --> 43:46.860
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.160 --> 43:51.060
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.760 --> 43:55.580
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.585 --> 44:00.340
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.360 --> 44:05.285
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.785 --> 44:08.516
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.540 --> 44:09.780
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.560 --> 44:14.420
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.235 --> 44:17.961
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.985 --> 44:19.420
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.910 --> 44:23.785
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.210 --> 44:25.561
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.585 --> 44:28.420
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.835 --> 44:31.316
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.340 --> 44:33.740
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.035 --> 44:36.061
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.085 --> 44:38.261
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.285 --> 44:42.500
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.860 --> 44:43.996
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.020 --> 44:47.060
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.235 --> 44:49.196
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.220 --> 44:51.940
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.500 --> 44:54.316
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.340 --> 44:56.836
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.860 --> 45:00.960
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
